      "review_notes": "The independent standard CUB law mixes one plus Binomial(m-1,1-\u03be) with the uniform categories1..m. Named selector and component adapters isolate representation equalities from the simple two-branch CTE composition. Independent tests establish the bias orientation: selector1/uncertainty0 gives m, selector1/uncertainty1 gives1; selector0 is uniform1..m independently of uncertainty. Infinite credits and arbitrary framed clients are checked. This is explicitly a derived named composition."
